{"overview":"داستانی دربارهٔ کینو که با تنها سلاح‌های خود برای محافظت و موتور‌سیکلت گویای خود، هرمس، به دور دنیا سفر می‌کند. کینو به بسیاری از جهان‌های اسرارآمیز می‌رود، هر کدام با آداب و مردم خاص خود، و از طریق داستان‌هایشان دربارهٔ جهان می‌آموزد؛ گاهی با شوخ‌طبعی و الهام‌بخشی، گاهی با بدبینی تیز. با این حال، قاعدهٔ کینو این است که در هر شهر بیش از سه روز نمی‌ماند؛ این زمان کافی است تا تقریباً همهٔ نکات مهم مکان را بیاموزد و همچنان زمان برای کشف سرزمین‌های جدید باقی بماند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"A story about Kino, who travels around the world with nothing but guns for protection and the talking motorcycle Hermes. Kino travels to many mystical worlds, each with its unique customs and people, and learns about the world through their stories, at times conjuring humor and inspiration or other times piercing cynicism. However, Kino's own custom is to stay no longer than three days in every town without exception, as it is enough time to learn almost everything important about the place while still leaving time to explore new lands.","tagline_en":"","runtime":24,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":12,"y":2017,"poster":"/5nT3eOsUlmiiVWckLHYJndoAAkH.jpg"}],"episodes":12,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"佐倉綾音","role":"Tifana (voice)","photo":"/yPbTmntASE9psPIMhNGU5oo6vIH.jpg","en":"Ayane Sakura"},{"name":"رین","role":"Shishō (voice)","photo":"/eJ2NqgzpnzNbT6Nt9EpDfzqNeZM.jpg","en":"Lynn"},{"name":"梅原裕一郎","role":"Shizu (voice)","photo":"/lScrvZi4tKKpk3PbnIjLVjHVNJn.jpg","en":"Yuuichirou Umehara"},{"name":"水瀬いのり","role":"Photo (voice)","photo":"/cqOrQDUbbQLKpujzcK47YqjFdNp.jpg","en":"Inori Minase"},{"name":"斉藤壮馬","role":"Hermes (voice)","photo":"/8W8Y02Jmjivw0kk5PDih9dqiyd9.jpg","en":"Soma Saito"},{"name":"興津和幸","role":"Aibō (voice)","photo":"/vgyaK5dAxhvzAi6LJM3ZyaJd4mJ.jpg","en":"Kazuyuki Okitsu"},{"name":"緒方恵美","role":"Sou (voice)","photo":"/eNdfMUyZgG5P4TNIZpbTAu8gBs9.jpg","en":"Megumi Ogata"},{"name":"松田健一郎","role":"Riku